{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/steam_baron.jpg?t=1748616824\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BARON \u2013 The First Realistic Open World Mafia RPG Set in Turkey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the criminal underworld of Ankara, <strong>BARON</strong> places players at the heart of a story about justice, loyalty, and revenge. After losing his parents at a young age, <strong>Alparslan</strong> takes a stand against a corrupt mafia regime to protect his neighborhood and uncover the truth behind his father\u2019s murder. But this is only the beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/malikane.png?t=1748616824\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf What to Expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f A highly immersive world reflecting Turkish culture and daily life<br>(local street vendors, neighborhood caf\u00e9s, Atat\u00fcrk statues, mosques)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f Fully voiced Turkish characters with professional dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f A deep, choice-driven story that shapes the future of your world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f Level-based character development and skill upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f Open-world exploration and dynamic missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f Day-night cycle and underground black market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f TPS/FPS gameplay mechanics with cinematic cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/Golbasi.png?t=1748616824\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude97 From Backstreets to Crime Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the hustle of Ankara\u2019s streets, echoes of prayer calls from minarets, and authentic local details \u2014 <strong>BARON</strong> is more than just an action game; it\u2019s a cultural experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc4a Your Choice: Justice or Power?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The decisions you make won\u2019t only affect Alparslan \u2014 they\u2019ll change the entire neighborhood. Will you show mercy or exact revenge? Will you build an empire, or die trying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/cami.png?t=1748616824\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679790?t=1748616824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679790?t=1748616824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748616824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748616824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2851430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/steam_baron.jpg?t=1748616824\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BARON \u2013 The First Realistic Open World Mafia RPG Set in Turkey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the criminal underworld of Ankara, <strong>BARON</strong> places players at the heart of a story about justice, loyalty, and revenge. After losing his parents at a young age, <strong>Alparslan</strong> takes a stand against a corrupt mafia regime to protect his neighborhood and uncover 